# iced-x86 keeps its decoder tables in a lazily built static (spin::Once) whose boxed handlers
# LeakSanitizer cannot reach through the table's encoding: kept for the process's life on purpose.
leak:iced_x86::decoder::table_de
# kura's JIT keeps the saved parts the page hands over for the process's life (their bytes and
# the inbox they come through); its late_tests hand parts over the same way (#242)
leak:kura::jit::late_tests::
